<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-ZAIRE WORLD CUP QUALIFIER MOVED TO TOGO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAIRE WORLD CUP QUALIFIER MOVED TO TOGO.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>FIFA said on Tuesday that because of the civil war in Zaire the country's next home World Cup qualifier against South Africa would be played in Togo.</p>
<p>The Africa group three clash is scheduled for Lome on April 27.</p>
<p>The civil unrest in the central African nation had already forced FIFA, soccer's world governing body, to move Zaire's previous qualifier against Zambia to Zimbabwe.</p>
</text>
